OL,3,GNEWSA'Living archive' display to mark
OL,4,Anuclear milestone
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople with a connection to the world's
OL,7,Foldest civil nuclear plant are being
OL,8,Finvited to dig out their memorabilia to
OL,9,Fmark 70 years since its opening.
OL,11,FCalder Hall in west Cumbria was opened
OL,12,Fby Queen Elizabeth II on 17 October
OL,13,F1956 and was the first nuclear power
OL,14,Fstation to provide domestic
OL,15,Felectricity.
OL,17,FThe site stopped producing energy in
OL,18,F2003, but to this day Sellafield
OL,19,Fdirectly employs more than 10,000
OL,20,Fpeople to decommission the site, making
OL,21,Fit one of the biggest employers in the
OL,22,Fcounty.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
